{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794491225,"nonce":"wYOkxXAUvM3ynK2YW+g3LaevINU=","title":"L5 — Paste-instead fallback for failed scrapes","message":"## Context\nTEMU may block the scraper, and Mercado Libre may change its layout. Failed rows need Retry and \"Pegar en su lugar\" (paste text or a screenshot that Gemini extracts). This layer is the paste part of plan Task 14 (`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-12-maeve.md:481`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/ui/input.rs` — failed-row actions\n- `src/ui/mod.rs` — messages `Retry`, `PasteText`, `PasteImage`, `FileDropped`, `Extracted`\n- `Cargo.toml` — add `arboard`\n\n## Approach\n- Text via `iced::clipboard::read`; image via `arboard` (encoded as PNG); a dropped image file applies to the row in paste mode\n- Gemini call through `extraction_request` + `extraction_into_product`; the result keeps the original URL and site, and its `missing` fields stay flagged\n- Retry re-scrapes that single item\n\n## Depends on\nL3; core 3bc0ebb L5 (`extraction_request`)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- `update` test: `Extracted(i, Ok(p))` → `Ready(p)` with the original URL\n- Manual: a pasted TEMU screenshot for a blocked item produces a product\n- Snap of a failed row in 4 combos reviewed\n- Gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`","files":null}]}